e a winning pattern.\\n        * Closed Wait: The winning tile must be a suited tile to complete a chow as the middle number. This pattern is not counted if there exists multiple tiles to complete a winning pattern.\\n        * Single Wait: The winning tile must be the tile to complete a pair. This pattern is not counted if there exists multiple tiles to complete a winning pattern.\\n        * Self Drawn: The winning tile must be drawn by the winner.\\n    Now is your turn, to your best ability, please briefly give a overview of the situation, evaluate a few proimsing moves, provide reason for your final choice, and output one of the valid actions with specified format.\\n        Your response format should be:\\n        Situation: [Your Observation]\\n        Evaluation: [Your Evaluation]\\n        Reason: [Your Reason]\\n        Answer: [Your Answer]\\n    \", \"user_prompt\": \"The following is the state information: The Prevailing Wind is: East Wind.Your Seat Wind is: East Wind.\\nUnshown tiles are: [W1: 4; W2: 4; W3: 3; W4: 4; W5: 4; W6: 3; W7: 1; W8: 3; W9: 3; T1: 3; T2: 3; T3: 2; T4: 3; T5: 4; T6: 3; T7: 4; T8: 3; T9: 4; B1: 4; B2: 4; B3: 4; B4: 3; B5: 4; B6: 2; B7: 1; B8: 4; B9: 2; F1: 1; F2: 3; F3: 4; F4: 4; J1: 4; J2: 3; J3: 3].\\nYour hand tiles are: [W3: 1; W5: 2; B1: 1; B2: 2; B3: 1].\\nYour melds are: [[T1, T2, T3],[F1, F1, F1]].\\nThe melds of the next player: [[]].\\nThe melds of the player sitting across: [[W7, W7, W7]].\\nThe melds of the previous player: [[]].\\nYour game history is: Play J2, Play T3, Chi T2, Play W7, Peng F1, Play B6, Play B9, Play W3.\\nThe game history of the next player is: Play F2, Play B6, Play W6, Play B7, Play B7.\\nThe game history of the player sitting across is: Play T4, Play T6, Peng W7, Play F1, Play J3, Play B9, Play B7.\\nThe game history of the previous player is: Play W9, Play T3, Play W8, Play T8, Play B4.\\nThe followings are your valid actions\\uff1a[Chi B3; Pass]\\u3002\", \"reasoning\": \"\", \"output\": \"Si